	<key>readme</key>
	<string>## World Time

Instant offline world clock and Raycast-style timezone converter for Alfred. Runs natively on macOS JavaScript (JXA) with zero external installs.

### Examples

- `now` — Local time + your pinned locations
- `now in chennai` / `now chennai` — Current time in Chennai
- `now in india` / `now in beijing` / `now in jfk` / `now in ist` — Cities, countries, airports, states, and timezone codes
- `now 5pm ldn in sf` / `now 14:30 tokyo to chennai` — Convert between any two places
- `now 5pm in chennai` — Convert local time to Chennai
- `now 5pm chennai` — Convert Chennai time to your local time
- `now 5pm tomorrow in tokyo` / `now 9am 2026-07-01 ldn in sf` — Convert on a specific date
- `now +2h30m` / `now in 4 hours in chennai` / `now tokyo + 4 hours` — Relative offsets
- `now diff paris` / `now diff sf to chennai` — Time difference
- `now 2026-03-15T14:30:00Z` / `now 1700000000 in chennai` — ISO 8601 and Unix timestamps

### Actions

- `↩` Copy time &amp; location summary
- `⌘↩` Copy time only
- `⌥↩` Copy ISO 8601 timestamp
- `⌃↩` Copy Unix epoch timestamp
- `⌘L` Show in Large Type</string>
